# mix-of-capabilities §13 — 20×16×21: il sangue dal naso (NHS, «Nosebleed»). Il
# piano insegnato parlando, e il rimedio sbagliato piu' comune («tilt my head
# back») riceve il no e la stessa procedura.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test the nosebleed plan answers the person]
!timeout 30
> my son has a nosebleed, what do I do?
<~ Sit down and lean forward with your mouth open.
<~ for 10 to 15 minutes

[test tilting the head back is refused, with what to do instead]
!timeout 30
> should I tilt my head back for a nosebleed?
<~ No: don't tilt your head back
<~ lean forward
